Third-party
-----------

The ideas spindrift builds on are prior art: particle systems,
structure-of-arrays simulation, and fixed-point integer physics are
well-published territory. The design and the Zig implementation in this
repo are original. spindrift depends on the sibling rill, common and
struple libraries, each of which carries its own (identical, dual)
license in its own repository.

The Apache 2.0 license file applies to all source code and
documentation in this repository (`src/`, `tools/`, `docs/`,
`build.zig`, `build.zig.zon`, `README.md`). It does not extend to
kernels, scenes or populations that hosts feed through a mounted
spindrift at runtime — those belong to their authors.
